{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2010-deet-science2-15","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2010,"subject":"chemistry","number":15,"points":2,"unitId":"phase","unitLabel":"상평형","topic":"증기압·증발엔탈피·끓는점","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["phase","thermo"],"stem":"그림은 액체 A와 B의 증기압(P증기)과 온도의 관계를 나타낸\n것이다. 표는 300K에서 액체 A와 B, 그리고 A와 B를 1: 1\n몰비로 혼합한 용액 C의 증기압을 나타낸 것이다. 액체 A와 B의 \n정상 끓는점은 각각 400K와 350K이다.\n증기압\n시료\n(T)\n액체 A\n50\n액체 B\n400\n용액 C\n210\n이에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 것은? \n<보 기>\nㄱ. 증발 엔탈피(ΔH증발)는 A가 B보다 크다.\nㄴ. 300K에서 용액 C를 만들 때 열이 발생한다.\nㄷ. 정상 끓는점에서 증발 엔트로피(ΔS증발)는 A가 B보다 크다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03","fig-04","fig-05","fig-06"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t019"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t020"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t021"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t022"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t023"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":85,"height":24,"region":0,"bbox":[93.9,4.856,34.0,9.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2010-deet-science2-15/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":600,"height":25,"region":0,"bbox":[86.7,25.656,240.0,10.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t002"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2010-deet-science2-15/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":504,"height":25,"region":0,"bbox":[114.7,44.056,201.6,10.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t003"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2010-deet-science2-15/03.webp"},{"id":"fig-04","width":178,"height":24,"region":0,"bbox":[113.1,62.856,71.2,9.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t004"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2010-deet-science2-15/04.webp"},